==English==
===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=to [[go]] [[against the grain]]}}

#{{idiom}} To [[defy]] [[convention]]; to do something in a manner that is [[unusual]] or [[out of the ordinary]].
#:''His method certainly '''goes against the grain''', but it is unquestionably effective.''

